WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 18]

01:44.820 --> 01:45.700
He Na.

01:45.860 --> 01:49.190
The immortal is just taking Fu back to temporary detention.

01:49.220 --> 01:50.620
There will be no problem.

01:50.700 --> 01:51.780
I'm the Demon King.

01:53.090 --> 01:54.259
When I say no,

01:55.060 --> 01:56.180
it means no.

01:59.259 --> 02:00.180
It's a pity.

02:01.260 --> 02:03.300
In the Aquatic Demons,

02:03.540 --> 02:05.980
not all of us listen to the Demon King.

02:09.889 --> 02:10.500
I'll go.

02:13.660 --> 02:14.420
Fu!

02:16.180 --> 02:17.100
In that case,

02:17.500 --> 02:19.060
we'll leave tomorrow morning.

02:19.060 --> 02:21.190
I'll give you one night to say goodbye.

02:44.940 --> 02:46.400
Meet the Immortal Master.

02:47.340 --> 02:49.270
I asked you to keep an eye on Liu Shao

02:49.300 --> 02:51.620
and prevent her from getting too close to Luo Ge.

02:51.620 --> 02:53.140
How could you let them

02:53.140 --> 02:54.940
go to the Demon Palace together?

02:55.380 --> 02:56.660
Immortal Master, please understand.

02:56.660 --> 02:58.579
It was Liu Shao who saw the immortal leave

02:58.579 --> 02:59.740
and followed him.

03:00.460 --> 03:01.620
After all, I didn't know

03:01.620 --> 03:02.940
Xiyin Mountain so well

03:03.460 --> 03:06.060
and not as well treated by the immortal as Liu Shao,

03:06.060 --> 03:07.720
who is close to Fairy Luo Ning.

03:08.140 --> 03:09.740
Everything went easy on her.

03:10.100 --> 03:10.540
I see.

03:10.900 --> 03:12.420
I'll give you a token

03:12.980 --> 03:15.540
with which you can come and go freely in the immortal world.

03:15.540 --> 03:16.800
As for Xiyin Mountain,

03:16.930 --> 03:18.700
I'll also tell Luo Ge

03:19.060 --> 03:20.220
not to stop you.

03:21.300 --> 03:22.900
Thank you, Immortal Master.

03:40.579 --> 03:41.220
Go back.

03:42.700 --> 03:43.630
Don't be so weak.

03:44.540 --> 03:45.740
I'm not that delicate

03:46.660 --> 03:47.590
as your brother.

03:48.260 --> 03:49.390
I can live a good life

03:49.820 --> 03:51.060
everywhere.

03:58.420 --> 03:59.880
Fu can't be out of the water

03:59.940 --> 04:01.270
for more than two hours.

04:01.980 --> 04:03.900
Otherwise, his life will be in danger.

04:03.900 --> 04:05.230
I will take care of that.

04:11.860 --> 04:12.580
Immortal,

04:13.020 --> 04:14.420
you should go back first.

04:14.420 --> 04:15.350
I have something

04:15.540 --> 04:16.500
to say to He Na.

04:41.659 --> 04:42.300
He Na.

04:42.940 --> 04:43.700
I'm sorry.

04:48.780 --> 04:49.620
This

04:50.380 --> 04:51.840
has nothing to do with you.

04:53.060 --> 04:54.420
I don't know

04:54.420 --> 04:56.530
what Fu has to do with the Four Seasons Monument.

04:56.530 --> 04:57.460
Neither do I know

04:57.900 --> 04:59.940
why Lu Sheng

05:00.530 --> 05:02.420
left such a warning before he was gone.

05:02.420 --> 05:03.220
But I know

05:03.740 --> 05:05.340
you are the most innocent one

05:05.460 --> 05:06.900
who has the hardest feelings

05:06.900 --> 05:07.980
in this.

05:13.020 --> 05:15.020
As the demon king of a cursed race,

05:16.540 --> 05:17.580
I'm destined to suffer

05:17.580 --> 05:19.240
these hard feelings and pain.

05:20.940 --> 05:22.740
I don't know what I can do.

05:23.500 --> 05:24.300
But He Na,

05:24.660 --> 05:25.920
I wish I could help you.

05:28.340 --> 05:30.460
Fu is now a prisoner for me.

05:31.340 --> 05:33.460
It's not easy for you to get a foothold in Immortal Palace.

05:33.460 --> 05:35.390
You can't be dragged down by me too.

05:36.650 --> 05:37.340
You won't.

05:38.100 --> 05:39.580
Luo Ge looks cold.

05:39.810 --> 05:41.540
But he won't give me a hard time.

05:44.980 --> 05:46.700
But Luo Ge is not the old Lu Li.

05:47.540 --> 05:48.060
Lu Li

05:49.490 --> 05:50.860
doesn't exist anymore.

05:51.260 --> 05:53.260
The one who took away my family just now

05:53.260 --> 05:54.990
is the heartless, emotionless

05:55.370 --> 05:57.500
but powerful Immortal Luo Ge.

05:59.620 --> 06:01.380
I won't let this happen again.

06:02.980 --> 06:03.820
From now on,

06:04.810 --> 06:05.740
I will strive for

06:06.540 --> 06:07.900
what I want,

06:09.220 --> 06:11.420
whether it's the survival of my people,

06:13.820 --> 06:15.330
or the people I care about.

06:17.260 --> 06:18.580
Do you mean Fu?

06:18.980 --> 06:19.660
And you.

06:24.660 --> 06:26.420
We've been through so much together.

06:26.420 --> 06:29.820
Of course, you are also one of the people I care about the most.

06:30.460 --> 06:31.020
He Na.

06:31.730 --> 06:32.620
Thank you.

06:32.860 --> 06:33.990
I'm always grateful

06:34.060 --> 06:35.460
to have a friend like you.

06:35.860 --> 06:37.590
Where's the pendant I gave you?

07:01.420 --> 07:03.220
It's water hyacinth?

07:04.340 --> 07:06.100
I borrowed some of the power of the Brahma tree.

07:06.100 --> 07:08.360
It can make the pendant more perceptive.

07:08.420 --> 07:09.550
Take it as a thank you

07:09.860 --> 07:12.120
for helping us to awaken the Brahma tree.

07:15.140 --> 07:15.860
He Na.

07:16.260 --> 07:16.860
Thank you.

07:17.900 --> 07:18.780
See you later.

07:26.180 --> 07:26.860
Liu Shao.

07:27.460 --> 07:28.390
You must not know

07:29.140 --> 07:31.810
the only woman who is qualified to use a water hyacinth accessory

07:31.810 --> 07:32.870
is the Demon Queen.

07:33.659 --> 07:34.720
I hope that one day,

07:35.020 --> 07:36.420
I can walk in the sunlight

07:36.650 --> 07:37.860
with my people

07:38.220 --> 07:39.020
to welcome you

07:39.659 --> 07:40.860
as my demon queen.

07:51.980 --> 07:54.310
You're locking me in the middle of the pool

07:54.500 --> 07:56.760
so that I can reach water whenever I want.

07:56.780 --> 07:57.740
It seems

07:58.780 --> 08:00.980
you're not as cruel as I thought.

08:57.940 --> 08:59.100
Brother just let me copy

08:59.100 --> 09:01.650
these useless scriptures and magic techniques.

09:01.650 --> 09:02.750
I guess I can't even

09:03.650 --> 09:04.660
beat the turtle demon in the pool

09:04.660 --> 09:05.970
with these.

09:05.970 --> 09:07.860
There are no turtles in Xiyin Mountain.

09:07.860 --> 09:09.580
You don't need to fight with anyone either.

09:09.580 --> 09:10.140
Brother.

09:10.900 --> 09:12.100
You're finally back.

09:12.690 --> 09:15.890
Have you finished copying the scriptures I assigned you?

09:17.060 --> 09:17.620
No.

09:18.500 --> 09:20.620
I've been copying sutras since I was a kid.

09:20.620 --> 09:22.220
There seems to be no end to it.

09:27.500 --> 09:28.220
Brother.

09:28.500 --> 09:29.460
I heard

09:29.460 --> 09:30.770
you brought a bad guy

09:30.770 --> 09:31.980
back to Xiyin Mountain.

09:31.980 --> 09:33.060
Can I

09:33.060 --> 09:34.020
use him to train spells

09:34.020 --> 09:34.860
and beat him for fun?

09:34.860 --> 09:35.740
No way.

09:35.740 --> 09:36.860
This man is cunning

09:37.020 --> 09:39.220
Don't even think about coming near him.

09:40.380 --> 09:42.020
I've set up a barrier in the place

09:42.020 --> 09:43.280
where he's being held.

09:44.180 --> 09:46.020
If you get within one foot of him,

09:47.060 --> 09:48.460
I will know immediately.

09:50.580 --> 09:51.460
Brother. Brother.

09:51.460 --> 09:53.980
Then, can I have fun in the mortal world?

09:54.220 --> 09:55.020
No, you can't.

09:55.770 --> 09:56.700
Brother.

09:57.140 --> 09:58.820
Can I go to the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors

09:58.820 --> 10:00.340
and learn magic with them?

10:00.340 --> 10:01.500
No, you can't.

10:04.780 --> 10:05.380
Then...

10:06.020 --> 10:08.340
Then, can I focus on the spells

10:08.340 --> 10:09.420
and never be lazy?

10:12.100 --> 10:12.820
It's a deal.

10:14.780 --> 10:16.100
Brother.

10:16.100 --> 10:17.700
It's no fun at all.

10:18.500 --> 10:20.030
Since you are so motivated,

10:20.900 --> 10:22.060
you have ten days

10:22.500 --> 10:23.630
to learn this charm.

10:30.980 --> 10:31.620
That's...

10:31.900 --> 10:33.900
That's so difficult.

10:35.690 --> 10:36.940
If I could learn it,

10:37.100 --> 10:38.700
I'd be the turtle in the pool.

10:44.980 --> 10:45.620
Brother.

10:45.770 --> 10:46.830
What are you doing?

10:47.260 --> 10:48.390
What a coincidence.

10:48.780 --> 10:50.140
The charm I showed you just now

10:50.140 --> 10:53.070
is the key to breaking my ban on you leaving the house.

10:53.380 --> 10:54.300
What?

10:54.940 --> 10:56.690
Brother, you can't do that.

10:56.690 --> 10:57.380
You...

10:57.660 --> 10:59.380
Please let me out!

11:05.500 --> 11:07.010
This is the Tears of the Half-Demon.

11:07.010 --> 11:07.740
It's for you.

11:08.860 --> 11:09.940
I promised you

11:09.940 --> 11:12.270
every time I go out, I will bring you a gift.

11:12.300 --> 11:13.900
Unlike someone in the pool,

11:19.100 --> 11:20.420
I always keep my word.

11:23.020 --> 11:23.580
Brother.

11:24.340 --> 11:25.900
Brother!

11:26.740 --> 11:29.460
Brother, let me out!

11:35.380 --> 11:36.460
Ten thousand years ago,

11:36.460 --> 11:38.300
the Demon King killed the Immortal Ze Shui.

11:38.300 --> 11:39.460
Ten thousand years later,

11:39.460 --> 11:42.060
the Demons are using demon string to cause trouble again,

11:42.060 --> 11:43.340
killing countless innocent people,

11:43.340 --> 11:44.900
almost causing a great disaster.

11:44.900 --> 11:47.430
How can we allow them to continue the rampage?

11:47.820 --> 11:49.100
Immortal, please give your order

11:49.100 --> 11:50.860
to send an army to the Demon Palace

11:50.860 --> 11:52.660
and wipe out the Aquatic Demons.

11:58.980 --> 11:59.820
Master Zhuo.

12:00.860 --> 12:01.860
What do you think?

12:02.260 --> 12:03.660
We practice immortal magic

12:03.660 --> 12:05.180
to protect the three worlds,

12:05.180 --> 12:06.580
not to suppress the weak.

12:06.980 --> 12:08.130
If we have to fight,

12:08.370 --> 12:10.500
we might as well wait for the evidence.

12:11.900 --> 12:13.230
Although our immortals

12:13.260 --> 12:14.900
should have compassion for all beings.

12:14.900 --> 12:16.300
But among the three worlds,

12:16.300 --> 12:18.180
the demon nature is the most uncontrollable.

12:18.180 --> 12:18.900
Since

12:18.900 --> 12:22.450
the demon string is indeed from the lineage of the demon king of the Aquatic Demons,

12:22.450 --> 12:23.900
it is the solid evidence.

12:24.180 --> 12:26.620
We shouldn't let the Aquatic Demons go.

12:27.020 --> 12:28.420
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:28.420 --> 12:29.570
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:29.570 --> 12:30.700
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:30.700 --> 12:32.500
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:32.500 --> 12:33.820
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:33.820 --> 12:34.740
Send the army to the Demon Palace!

12:34.740 --> 12:35.740
Quiet, everyone.

12:36.980 --> 12:40.110
Since Xiyuan Mountain is in charge of the investigation

12:40.300 --> 12:44.060
and Luo Ge is the only Immortal in the Immortal Palace,

12:45.130 --> 12:47.650
let's follow his order.

12:52.940 --> 12:53.970
As is known,

12:54.900 --> 12:56.780
Master Zhuo and I have always been at odds.

12:56.780 --> 12:57.660
But this time,

12:58.620 --> 12:59.820
I'm with Master Zhuo.

13:00.740 --> 13:02.620
We've been cultivating for thousands of years,

13:02.620 --> 13:05.530
aiming to stabilize the three worlds and protect all beings.

13:05.530 --> 13:06.990
The demons can be good too.

13:07.460 --> 13:09.420
Even if there are evil demons with a taste for killing,

13:09.420 --> 13:11.880
the whole demon race shouldn't be involved.

13:13.500 --> 13:15.500
If we don't care about good and evil,

13:16.100 --> 13:17.690
what's the difference between us

13:17.690 --> 13:19.750
and the demons who kill the innocent?

13:20.580 --> 13:21.580
Immortal Master.

13:22.420 --> 13:23.550
Sorry to offend you.

13:30.740 --> 13:31.540
Shang Yurong.

13:31.700 --> 13:32.380
Come out.

13:34.140 --> 13:34.980
Shang Yurong.

13:39.130 --> 13:39.740
Zhuo.

13:40.620 --> 13:41.880
You're looking for me?

13:42.820 --> 13:43.900
There was a discussion on whether to attack the Demon Palace

13:43.900 --> 13:45.260
in the Litian Temple today,

13:45.260 --> 13:46.390
why didn't you come?

13:46.980 --> 13:48.300
You just gave me

13:48.300 --> 13:49.780
the next book of the Great Sword Formation.

13:49.780 --> 13:51.380
Of course I have to practice.

13:51.420 --> 13:52.020
What?

13:52.580 --> 13:53.620
Someone was being mean to you?

13:53.620 --> 13:54.490
Tell me who it is.

13:54.490 --> 13:55.820
I'll teach him a lesson.

13:55.980 --> 13:56.910
That's not true.

13:57.460 --> 13:59.820
But it's rare to see Luo Ge being kind

13:59.820 --> 14:00.950
and agreeing with me

14:00.980 --> 14:02.660
on not attacking the Demon Palace.

14:02.660 --> 14:03.460
That's fine.

14:03.900 --> 14:05.410
If he dares not help you,

14:05.410 --> 14:06.820
I'll confront him later.

14:06.940 --> 14:08.670
You've acquired “Burning Sea”

14:09.020 --> 14:10.420
and dare to fight him now?

14:11.260 --> 14:13.260
You're not afraid of being gagged by him?

14:13.260 --> 14:14.060
Okay, okay.

14:14.300 --> 14:15.540
I'll work hard.

14:15.740 --> 14:16.340
By the way,

14:18.340 --> 14:19.340
this is for you.

14:19.740 --> 14:20.470
What's this?

14:20.530 --> 14:21.500
It's the flower marrow

14:21.500 --> 14:22.740
I found

14:22.980 --> 14:24.700
when practicing the sword in the mountains.

14:24.700 --> 14:26.230
I want you to have it. Try it.

14:26.300 --> 14:26.820
So

14:26.820 --> 14:29.140
while practicing, you went to pick up the flower?

14:29.140 --> 14:30.820
It's not a big deal for me to age.

14:30.820 --> 14:32.380
I don't need you to waste time.

14:32.380 --> 14:34.710
You should've spent the time practicing.

14:34.820 --> 14:35.900
Okay, okay.

14:36.020 --> 14:36.740
From today onwards,

14:36.740 --> 14:37.740
I will work hard.

14:38.060 --> 14:39.250
I will show the whole Immortal Palace

14:39.250 --> 14:42.910
what I'm capable of as the master of the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

15:21.260 --> 15:22.120
You can get out.

15:22.660 --> 15:23.260
I'm fine.

15:23.900 --> 15:26.430
Is this about the sword cut you blocked for me?

15:26.460 --> 15:27.340
Is the sword

15:27.460 --> 15:28.540
mixed with

15:28.940 --> 15:30.380
the poisonous energy of the Brahma Lotus

15:30.380 --> 15:32.220
which has made you hurt worse?

15:32.700 --> 15:34.030
It's just a sword wound.

15:34.460 --> 15:35.660
It's already healed.

15:41.420 --> 15:43.600
Since you said it's already healed,

15:44.220 --> 15:46.330
it must be.

15:47.420 --> 15:49.620
So I'll leave now.

15:57.180 --> 15:57.500
Oh.

15:57.780 --> 15:58.380
By the way,

15:58.580 --> 15:59.500
I'll bring in

15:59.500 --> 16:00.620
the medicine I made for you.

16:00.620 --> 16:01.700
Don't come out.

16:01.900 --> 16:03.430
You have to have a good rest.

16:10.540 --> 16:11.200
Be careful.

16:15.340 --> 16:16.060
Heartbeat.

16:17.260 --> 16:18.590
It's Lu Li's heartbeat.

16:29.940 --> 16:31.140
Why are you so stupid?

16:39.540 --> 16:40.580
Lu Li.

16:44.490 --> 16:45.700
Lu Li is still here.

16:53.620 --> 16:55.140
Luo Ge wouldn't remind me.

16:57.700 --> 16:58.980
But Lu Li would.

17:01.220 --> 17:02.750
Luo Ge wouldn't comfort me.

17:04.940 --> 17:06.099
But Lu Li would.

17:09.220 --> 17:11.420
Luo Ge doesn't like people to touch him,

17:12.300 --> 17:14.160
not even the piece of his clothes.

17:20.619 --> 17:21.950
But I can do that to Lu Li.

17:39.380 --> 17:40.310
Do you remember?

17:42.460 --> 17:44.220
Lu Li loved to do this.

17:50.340 --> 17:51.740
You're overthinking it.

18:05.740 --> 18:06.460
It's Lu Li.

18:07.620 --> 18:08.500
Lu Li is back.

18:19.140 --> 18:20.540
I'm not Lu Li.

18:21.740 --> 18:22.500
I'm not.

18:36.420 --> 18:37.060
Master.

18:39.180 --> 18:39.780
Master.

18:43.720 --> 18:51.320
[Half-demon Lu Sheng]

18:51.410 --> 18:52.340
It's not true.

18:53.580 --> 18:54.500
It's not true.

18:57.900 --> 18:58.660
Master.

19:00.180 --> 19:02.060
I'm late.

19:06.660 --> 19:07.380
Master.

19:08.700 --> 19:09.940
Who was it?

19:11.060 --> 19:12.380
Who did this to you?

19:16.860 --> 19:17.700
Master.

19:19.740 --> 19:20.860
I will not let you

19:21.660 --> 19:23.820
die in vain like this.

19:25.580 --> 19:27.820
I will find the person who did this to you

19:29.020 --> 19:30.820
and make him pay for it.

19:36.420 --> 19:37.300
Master.

19:47.140 --> 19:47.930
Master.

19:48.900 --> 19:50.340
I must become stronger.

19:51.780 --> 19:53.260
Even without your help,

19:54.180 --> 19:56.710
I have to establish myself in Immortal Palace

19:57.060 --> 19:58.300
and get Luo Ge back.

20:04.460 --> 20:05.500
Master.

20:06.900 --> 20:08.430
If you're watching over me,

20:09.820 --> 20:11.100
you must help me.

20:23.660 --> 20:24.980
This is the magic weapon

20:24.980 --> 20:27.980
Master used

20:27.980 --> 20:29.380
to hide his demonic aura.

20:29.420 --> 20:30.660
With this,

20:31.260 --> 20:33.330
I'll be able to use

20:33.980 --> 20:35.660
Ao Hen's demon energy

20:38.140 --> 20:39.940
Her Majesty is dead! Run!

20:42.740 --> 20:44.000
Ao Hen's demon energy.

21:26.100 --> 21:27.560
All demons, on my command.

21:31.220 --> 21:33.540
Spread out and collect the spirit energy.

21:33.540 --> 21:34.940
All of you!

21:36.100 --> 21:38.630
I thought the energy belonged to Her Majesty.

21:38.940 --> 21:39.980
Who is she?

21:40.340 --> 21:41.670
That's some tough talk.

21:42.140 --> 21:43.820
I thought Her Majesty had returned.

21:43.820 --> 21:44.420
That's strange.

21:44.420 --> 21:46.220
Isn't this Her Majesty's magic?

21:50.620 --> 21:51.940
Who else wants to die?

21:54.980 --> 21:55.690
We're here

21:55.780 --> 21:56.820
to greet the new king.

21:56.820 --> 21:58.660
Meet the new king.

21:58.660 --> 21:59.820
Meet the new king.

22:02.210 --> 22:03.580
I will become stronger

22:03.980 --> 22:05.440
and get everything I want,

22:06.210 --> 22:08.730
whether it's Luo Ge or power.

22:09.500 --> 22:10.900
Those who stand in my way,

22:11.380 --> 22:13.460
I will kill them all.

22:17.620 --> 22:18.820
Don't worry about it.

22:18.940 --> 22:19.860
For immortal,

22:20.140 --> 22:21.500
even the gravest of injuries

22:21.500 --> 22:23.230
would take only a night to heal.

22:23.260 --> 22:24.260
There was one time

22:24.300 --> 22:25.740
when I scratched him,

22:26.020 --> 22:29.060
the blood marks on his face were still there the next day.

22:29.060 --> 22:30.740
I wonder if the poison of the Brahma Lotus

22:30.740 --> 22:32.700
is specifically bad for the immortal.

22:32.700 --> 22:33.980
It hurt him so badly.

22:35.300 --> 22:36.060
Don't worry.

22:36.340 --> 22:38.140
The Brahma Lotus can't kill him.

22:38.220 --> 22:39.340
Don't underestimate

22:39.340 --> 22:40.860
my 10,000 years of cultivation.

22:40.860 --> 22:41.990
I've checked it out.

22:43.780 --> 22:46.180
The most amazing thing about Xuan Ling Wood is

22:45.760 --> 22:48.780
[Xuan Ling Wood]

22:46.700 --> 22:49.220
its ability to clear the mind

22:49.620 --> 22:51.340
and keep it pure.

22:51.420 --> 22:54.880
It's the most beneficial treasure for immortal cultivation.

22:55.220 --> 22:56.500
That's a relief.

23:16.740 --> 23:17.600
Clear the mind.

23:28.820 --> 23:29.740
Clear the mind.

23:44.740 --> 23:45.600
Clear the mind.

23:55.220 --> 23:55.940
Lu Li.

23:56.660 --> 23:59.590
What exactly did you experience in the mortal world?

24:00.090 --> 24:02.340
How come I've used up all the spiritual power of Xuan Ling Wood

24:02.340 --> 24:05.140
and your distractions still can't be washed away?

24:11.220 --> 24:12.140
Immortal.

24:19.380 --> 24:20.020
Immortal.

24:21.740 --> 24:23.020
Master, please take a look.

24:23.020 --> 24:24.260
What's wrong with him?

24:24.260 --> 24:26.140
I thought you said can recover from the poison by himself

24:26.140 --> 24:26.660
and

24:26.660 --> 24:27.900
the spiritual power of the Xuan Ling Wood

24:27.900 --> 24:29.160
could cure the poison.

24:31.780 --> 24:32.580
It's strange.

24:32.980 --> 24:34.110
How can this happen?

24:35.060 --> 24:36.390
He's not just poisoned.

24:36.740 --> 24:38.460
His wound hasn't healed.

24:38.780 --> 24:40.020
His body has always been able to

24:40.020 --> 24:41.380
heal himself.

24:41.780 --> 24:43.170
But now his immortal power is so weak.

24:43.170 --> 24:45.180
Hasn't he been recuperating in the quiet room?

24:45.180 --> 24:45.910
Now it's like

24:46.100 --> 24:47.780
he he has just been in a fight.

24:48.060 --> 24:49.420
Cut it off.

24:49.420 --> 24:50.620
See how to cure him.

24:51.300 --> 24:53.180
I don't know the cause. How can I cure him?

24:53.180 --> 24:53.780
But

24:53.940 --> 24:56.740
I can use Xuan Ling Wood to remove the poison first.

25:04.420 --> 25:04.880
What...

25:05.500 --> 25:07.060
Why did the Xuan Ling Mu become like this?

25:07.060 --> 25:08.300
Why is it so lethargic?

25:08.300 --> 25:09.700
The leaves are withered.

25:10.140 --> 25:12.140
The wood is nourished by immortal power,

25:12.140 --> 25:13.780
and not by the rain and dew of the earth.

25:13.780 --> 25:15.020
Could it be that the immortal

25:15.020 --> 25:16.540
wanted to use Xuan Ling Wood to get rid of the poison,

25:16.540 --> 25:17.820
but the wood

25:18.140 --> 25:19.530
had a serious lack of spiritual power,

25:19.530 --> 25:22.540
He tried to nourish it with his own immortal power, and depleted it in the process?

25:22.540 --> 25:24.420
so his immortal power got overdrawn?

25:24.420 --> 25:26.260
Should we get the Immortal Master to help?

25:26.260 --> 25:27.120
Are you stupid?

25:27.460 --> 25:28.180
If they knew

25:28.340 --> 25:30.060
the immortal is hurt like this because of you,

25:30.060 --> 25:30.990
they'd kill you.

25:31.700 --> 25:33.900
Besides, their immortal power

25:34.620 --> 25:36.880
is not enough to water the Xuan Ling Wood.

25:38.620 --> 25:41.780
Does this tree have to be watered with immortal power?

25:42.140 --> 25:43.300
Divine spirit

25:44.060 --> 25:44.980
But

25:45.170 --> 25:46.340
there hasn't been a God in 10,000 years

25:46.340 --> 25:48.530
in the Immortal Palace.

25:49.220 --> 25:50.880
What about the divine spirit?

26:03.260 --> 26:04.420
It can't work.

26:06.260 --> 26:06.980
But the boundary

26:06.980 --> 26:09.040
doesn't seem as stable as yesterday.

26:10.340 --> 26:12.600
Could something have happened to Luo Ge?

26:13.220 --> 26:14.280
If that's the case,

26:15.500 --> 26:17.160
it'll be a great opportunity.

26:32.020 --> 26:33.420
There's one more ban on someone else

26:33.420 --> 26:35.340
above the boundary.

26:36.540 --> 26:39.540
It seems that Luo Ge doesn't want someone to come to me.

26:39.660 --> 26:40.740
In this way,

26:42.090 --> 26:43.690
I'd like to meet this person.

26:43.980 --> 26:45.780
Although I can't break the boundary,

26:45.780 --> 26:46.580
this kind of ban

26:46.580 --> 26:47.660
can't hold me back.

27:03.420 --> 27:04.060
It's done.

27:05.420 --> 27:06.050
But

27:07.180 --> 27:08.460
who is this person

27:09.980 --> 27:11.710
that Luo Ge cares so much about?

27:27.540 --> 27:29.140
Xuan Ling Wood is spiritual.

27:29.220 --> 27:31.180
If you try to connect with it spiritually,

27:31.180 --> 27:33.110
and give it your spiritual energy,

27:33.140 --> 27:35.200
it will take in your spiritual power.

27:35.220 --> 27:36.620
But it's a tree after all.

27:36.860 --> 27:38.850
If you can't run your divine spirit freely,

27:38.850 --> 27:40.930
it will empty your spiritual energy.

27:41.220 --> 27:42.280
It's very painful.

27:42.540 --> 27:43.800
You have to be careful.

28:04.580 --> 28:05.460
Liu… Liu Shao.

28:45.450 --> 28:46.020
I'm cold.

29:05.580 --> 29:06.180
Lu Li.

29:10.700 --> 29:11.290
Lu Li.

29:13.580 --> 29:14.380
Lu Li.

29:15.220 --> 29:15.930
Lu Li.

29:17.940 --> 29:18.900
Immortal Luo Ge,

29:19.980 --> 29:22.180
the three palaces have gathered at Litian Hall for a discussion.

29:22.180 --> 29:24.100
The Immortal Master sent me

29:24.300 --> 29:26.030
to ask you if you can be present.

29:26.740 --> 29:27.220
No.

29:43.940 --> 29:44.660
Lu Li.

29:46.100 --> 29:47.140
Lu Li.

29:54.860 --> 29:55.540
Lu Li.

29:58.780 --> 30:00.310
You have made a sinful bond.

30:02.020 --> 30:03.820
But now it's me who owes her a lot.

30:45.980 --> 30:48.180
How dare these demons to be so reckless?

30:48.300 --> 30:49.540
Marquis Wuyang and Ao Hen

30:49.540 --> 30:51.420
were killed in the Battle of Lusitai.

30:51.420 --> 30:53.940
The mortal and the demon world naturally fall into chaos.

30:53.940 --> 30:54.820
How dare they!

30:55.140 --> 30:57.140
Where do they leave our Immortal Palace?

30:57.140 --> 30:59.930
Don't we have someone decisive in Immortal Palace?

30:59.930 --> 31:01.190
Why do we have to worry?

31:04.500 --> 31:05.500
Immortal Master,

31:06.700 --> 31:08.860
Immortal Luo Ge doesn't want to come.

31:09.020 --> 31:11.020
He... he...

31:11.090 --> 31:12.350
What's wrong with him?

31:13.460 --> 31:15.860
He's at Liu Shao's bedside for some reason.

31:16.060 --> 31:17.260
for a day and a night.

31:17.780 --> 31:19.710
And no one else is allowed to enter,

31:19.980 --> 31:21.060
not even me.

32:24.780 --> 32:26.510
I seem to have had a dream again.

32:27.570 --> 32:28.860
I dreamt of Lu Li.

32:31.180 --> 32:31.820
No.

32:32.940 --> 32:33.980
It's Luo Ge.

32:46.660 --> 32:47.780
Immortal Luo Ge.

32:50.420 --> 32:51.750
Are you feeling better?

32:54.050 --> 32:54.820
I'm fine.

32:56.060 --> 32:57.590
I need to thank you for this.

32:59.540 --> 33:00.860
You know about it?

33:03.500 --> 33:04.580
Some of the spiritual power

33:04.580 --> 33:06.450
in your divine spirit was taken away,

33:06.450 --> 33:07.310
it was painful.

33:08.540 --> 33:10.270
But it's not a bad thing for you.

33:13.900 --> 33:15.820
The spiritual energy you re-cultivate

33:15.820 --> 33:17.750
integrates better with yourself.

33:18.340 --> 33:19.940
The power of the God of the Sun

33:20.230 --> 33:22.200
can hopefully become your own.

33:24.010 --> 33:24.770
In that case,

33:24.810 --> 33:26.450
I've been blessed by a disaster.

33:26.450 --> 33:27.380
Open your mouth.

33:31.020 --> 33:32.280
What is that?

33:34.970 --> 33:35.900
The pill

33:36.190 --> 33:37.580
is made from many medicinal herbs

33:37.580 --> 33:40.580
combined with the spiritual energy of Xuan Ling Wood.

33:41.780 --> 33:42.950
It's beneficial

33:43.200 --> 33:44.460
for your cultivation.

33:44.970 --> 33:47.170
The spiritual energy of Xuan Ling Wood?

33:58.240 --> 33:59.300
What are you doing?

34:00.800 --> 34:01.770
The spiritual energy of Xuan Ling Wood

34:01.770 --> 34:03.100
can cleanse one's mind.

34:03.320 --> 34:04.120
Should I

34:04.160 --> 34:05.820
cut off my thoughts about you…

34:08.780 --> 34:10.290
About Lu Li then?

34:10.710 --> 34:11.340
No way.

34:11.969 --> 34:13.030
I can't forget Lu Li

34:13.150 --> 34:14.370
even if I die.

34:18.780 --> 34:19.980
You won't forget him.

34:22.600 --> 34:23.980
If you love him so much,

34:25.239 --> 34:26.920
all the power of Xuan Ling Wood

34:28.060 --> 34:31.120
won't be able to wipe off the feelings in the slightest.

34:41.159 --> 34:44.020
But worldly love is so stubborn and uninteresting.

34:44.139 --> 34:45.400
It only causes trouble

34:45.780 --> 34:47.380
when you fall deeper into it.

34:48.429 --> 34:49.760
You are uninteresting.

34:55.480 --> 34:56.940
Being in the three worlds,

34:57.710 --> 34:58.880
I've seen all beings

34:59.640 --> 35:00.840
and cleansed my mind.

35:01.490 --> 35:02.620
I am uninteresting.

35:06.110 --> 35:06.910
You should meet interesting people

35:06.910 --> 35:08.710
who you have more in common with,

35:10.850 --> 35:12.510
so that you won't be confined.

35:15.010 --> 35:16.150
Immortal Luo Ge,

35:18.750 --> 35:20.600
Lu Li is the interesting person

35:20.600 --> 35:22.260
who has a lot in common with me.

35:31.350 --> 35:33.370
You said I couldn't touch you,

35:33.580 --> 35:35.380
not even a piece of your clothes.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.360
But why

35:38.490 --> 35:39.460
did you allow me

35:40.250 --> 35:42.450
to grab your sleeve for the whole night?

35:58.190 --> 35:58.780
Luo Ge.

36:03.770 --> 36:04.570
Thank you.

36:07.850 --> 36:08.900
You protected me

36:09.900 --> 36:10.830
all night long.

36:12.090 --> 36:13.020
That's not true.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.080
I just

36:17.250 --> 36:18.250
never owe anyone.

36:24.560 --> 36:25.400
Wait for me.

36:32.160 --> 36:32.840
Immortal,

36:33.340 --> 36:35.360
the Immortal Master sent me to ask you for advice.

36:35.360 --> 36:37.080
The demons have aroused a sudden calamity in the mortal world.

36:37.080 --> 36:39.220
I wonder if you can go there to quell the demons.

36:39.220 --> 36:40.900
Go back and tell the Immortal Master.

36:40.900 --> 36:41.570
I will go.

36:42.030 --> 36:42.500
Yes.

36:44.470 --> 36:45.140
Immortal,

36:48.040 --> 36:50.140
although the poison of Brahma Lotus has been removed,

36:50.140 --> 36:52.240
you haven't fully recovered from the wound.

36:52.240 --> 36:54.130
You shouldn't go out now.

36:55.850 --> 36:57.360
Many people were not happy with me

36:57.360 --> 36:58.820
when I defended the demons

36:59.460 --> 37:00.560
in Litian Hall.

37:02.110 --> 37:03.440
I don't care about this.

37:04.120 --> 37:05.580
But Immortal Master does.

37:07.690 --> 37:08.660
He is my master.

37:09.960 --> 37:11.770
I can't put him in this.

37:13.200 --> 37:14.400
I'll go with you then.

37:19.330 --> 37:19.920
You?

37:21.220 --> 37:22.310
I come from the mortal world.

37:22.310 --> 37:24.240
Maybe I can help you.

37:29.450 --> 37:31.680
As you please.

37:35.670 --> 37:36.630
Wait for me.

37:50.620 --> 37:52.210
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

38:24.010 --> 38:24.380
Xue.

38:24.380 --> 38:24.850
Jian.

38:25.390 --> 38:25.900
Xue.

38:35.810 --> 38:37.280
Kill these two people.

38:37.780 --> 38:39.040
Suck out the vitality.

38:39.170 --> 38:40.340
Give it to the new king.

38:40.340 --> 38:42.110
Who is your new king?

38:56.850 --> 38:57.650
Xue.

39:02.270 --> 39:02.650
Moon…

39:02.940 --> 39:03.650
Moon Sword?

39:04.830 --> 39:05.250
Is…

39:05.880 --> 39:07.210
Is this Immortal Luo Ge?

39:17.930 --> 39:18.390
Xue.

39:19.280 --> 39:20.010
Are you okay?

39:20.160 --> 39:20.960
Yes, I'm fine.

39:26.120 --> 39:27.510
Who is your new king?

39:30.490 --> 39:31.670
Answer my question.

39:32.460 --> 39:33.010
Who

39:34.100 --> 39:35.400
is your new king?

39:36.160 --> 39:36.620
I…

39:36.960 --> 39:38.010
I can't say.

39:38.470 --> 39:39.310
If I do,

39:39.730 --> 39:41.860
the new king will make us die horribly.

39:48.420 --> 39:49.390
I heard

39:51.110 --> 39:54.770
you've killed many of the disciples in the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

40:14.880 --> 40:16.600
You crossed the world to kill people

40:16.600 --> 40:18.800
and reached the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

40:20.010 --> 40:22.210
Where do you leave the Immortal Palace?

40:44.580 --> 40:45.840
You're their new king?

40:46.510 --> 40:46.970
No.

40:47.770 --> 40:49.170
Then why do you come here?

40:51.460 --> 40:52.980
Thank you for saving my whole clan from death

40:52.980 --> 40:54.610
in the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

40:54.610 --> 40:55.540
At the same time,

40:56.130 --> 40:57.990
I want to inform you of something.

40:58.900 --> 40:59.530
What is it?

41:00.620 --> 41:01.710
The Aquatic Demons

41:02.380 --> 41:04.060
were once the kings of the entire demon realm.
